则一切正常。\n若显示“False”，则中止生成，并将下方“疑似宽度”和“高度节点”的值填入加载视频节点的自定义宽度和高度中。\n在这种情况下：\n输入：以自定义高度为值\n输入假定高度值作为定制宽度"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [262.5461730957031, 174.64378356933594], "pos": [-0.15429000556468964, 142.8494110107422], "id": 206, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["可选提示。您可以留空，让模型自行“猜测”左右两侧应补绘的内容。\n或者您可以描述希望在外扩区域看到的内容。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [385.25836181640625, 88], "pos": [464.76397705078125, 251.36949157714844], "id": 196, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [210, 100], "pos": [439.7345886230469, 386.58038330078125], "widgets_values": ["raw value", "80.96"], "inputs": [{"name": "input", "link": 297, "label": "输入", "type": "*", "localized_name": "input"}, {"widget": {"name": "mode"}, "name": "mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "模式"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 207, "type": "DisplayAny", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui_essentials", "ver": "9d9f4bedfc9f0321c19faf71855e228c93bd0dc9", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"mode": true}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "DisplayAny"}, "order": 23}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["源帧计数将显示源视频的长度\n（可悲的是，只有在开始生成之后才看得到）\n输入目标视频的长度（以帧为单位）。你可以估计一下。\n您还可以输入比源视频更长的持续时间。它实际上会将视频扩展一点（然后淡入灰色方块）。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [470.7293395996094, 101.37345123291016], "pos": [421.4781188964844, 518.4405517578125], "id": 191, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["  \n--------\n\n## 说明:  \n**我会把原始笔记留在这里，但我不知道他们为什么选择Causvid T2V Loras。  \n这是一个奇怪的选择，因为这不是T2V工作流。  \n我添加了I2V FusionX Lora，它用起来更好。**  \nLora:  \nhttps://huggingface.co/vrgamedevgirl84/Wan14BT2VFusioniX/resolve/main/FusionX_LoRa/Wan2.1_I2V_14B_FusionX_LoRA.safetensors\n\n\n  \n--------\n\nOriginal Notes:\n\n[Tutorial](https://docs.comfy.org/tutorials/video/wan/vace) | [教程](https://docs.comfy.org/zh-CN/tutorials/video/wan/vace)\n\n[Causvid Lora extracted  by Kijai](https://www.reddit.com/r/StableDiffusion/comments/1knuafk/causvid_lora_massive_speedup_for_wan21_made_by/) Thanks to CausVid MIT\n\n##  14B 支持 480P 720P\n\n**Diffusion Model**\n- [wan2.1_vace_14B_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/wan2.1_vace_14B_fp16.safetensors)\n\n**LoRA**\n- [Wan21_CausVid_14B_T2V_lora_rank32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/blob/main/Wan21_CausVid_14B_T2V_lora_rank32.safetensors)\n\n供参考：使用 RTX 4090 显卡测试该工作流程时，在 720P 分辨率下以 81 帧/秒的帧率运行完整程序大约需要 40 分钟。\n使用 Wan21_CausVid_14B_T2V_lora_rank32.safetensors 后，可能只需 4 分钟左右即可完成。 \n\n## 1.3B Support 480P only\n\n**Diffusion Model**\n- [wan2.1_vace_1.3B_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/wan2.1_vace_1.3B_fp16.safetensors)\n\n**LoRA**\n- [Wan21_CausVid_bidirect2_T2V_1_3B_lora_rank32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/blob/main/Wan21_CausVid_bidirect2_T2V_1_3B_lora_rank32.safetensors)\n\n供参考：使用Wan21_CausVid_bidirect2_T2V_1_3B_lora_rank32.safetensors后，可能只需要大约 2 分钟。\n## Other Models\n\n* 如果您之前使用过 Wan 工作流程，则可能已经拥有这些模型。\n\n**VAE**\n- [wan_2.1_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors?download=true)\n\n**Text encoders**   Chose one of following model\n- [umt5_xxl_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp16.safetensors?download=true)\n- [umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors?download=true)\n\n> 你可以选择 fp16 或 fp8；我使用fp16是为了与Kijai的封装器兼容。\n文件保存路径\n\n```\nComfyUI/\n├── models/\n│   ├── diffusion_models/\n│   │   ├-── wan2.1_vace_14B_fp16.safetensors\n│   │   └─── wan2.1_vace_1.3B_fp16.safetensors \n│   ├── text_encoders/\n│   │   └─── umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors # or fp16\n│   ├── loras/\n│   │   ├── Wan21_CausVid_14B_T2V_lora_rank32.safetensors\n│   │   └── Wan21_CausVid_bidirect2_T2V_1_3B_lora_rank32.safetensors\n│   └── vae/\n│       └──  wan_2.1_vae.safetensors\n```\n  \n## 关于 CausVid Lora\n\n我们已默认启用CausVid LoRA以实现加速效果。但某些情况下视频可能出现抖动或模糊现象。建议您尝试不同强度的LoRA参数以获得最佳效果，参数值应在0.3至0.7之间。如无需此功能，可使用旁路模式禁用，并将`KSampler`设置恢复为默认配置。\n\n## 关于模型选择 \n\n14B模型的生成质量更高，但生成耗时更长。若已下载模型，可选择直接使用上方节点，或仅修改加载器节点加载的模型。\n对应的LoRA应与扩散模型匹配。例如，14B扩散模型对应的LoRA即为14B LoRA。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [517.4406127929688, 1079.0904541015625], "pos": [-779.7687377929688, 1068.497314453125], "id": 183, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 14}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.26.11", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "node_versions": {"comfy-core": "0.3.34"}, "ds": {"offset": [1078.6590164639717, -885.7701950925187], "scale": 0.7247295000000024}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "Sampling &